# Authentication uses database-backed accounts and sessions.
# Do not put account passwords in this file or in Git.
# Local synchronization is disabled by default. For an isolated test environment:
# ODOO_ENABLED=false
# ODOO_URL=https://your-instance.odoo.com
# ODOO_COMPANY_ID=3
# ODOO_SOURCE=Local test
# Put ODOO_API_KEY only in ignored .dev.vars; production uses a Worker secret.
